    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DAYDREAM: A Childhood Nostalgia Horror Game</u></strong><br>A surreal co-op horror game where the places you once loved become the things you fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A journey through forgotten childhood</strong><br>Explore detailed, realistic environments inspired by childhood spaces like arcades, playplaces, and bedrooms. These locations once felt safe, but now something is off.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for immersion</strong><br>With high-quality visuals and a minimal interface, every space is designed to feel like a real memory. You\u2019re not just playing a game, you're stepping into the past.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play together or get left behind</strong><br>Daydream is a four-player co-op experience. Work with your team to solve puzzles, collect strange items, document entities, and find a way out. Going off alone could cost you everything.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dream that slowly turns</strong><br>At first, the world feels calm and nostalgic. Familiar music, soft lighting, and whimsical colors create a comforting mood. But it doesn\u2019t stay that way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted liminal spaces</strong><br>Each level is designed by hand with no procedural generation. Childhood landmarks are reimagined as eerie, decaying places where nothing feels quite right.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying enemies that learn from you</strong><br>Every entity is unique. Some react to sound. Some follow you quietly. Each one is a puzzle, and your survival depends on paying attention and adapting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-solving with consequences</strong><br>Environmental puzzles are woven into each realm. Solving them unlocks new areas, but also new dangers. Your choices shape the experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound that guides and misleads</strong><br>A mix of eerie ambient sound and nostalgic melodies brings each environment to life. Sometimes comforting. Sometimes haunting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DAYDREAM: A Childhood Nostalgia Horror Game</u></strong><br>A surreal co-op horror game where the places you once loved become the things you fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A journey through forgotten childhood</strong><br>Explore detailed, realistic environments inspired by childhood spaces like arcades, playplaces, and bedrooms. These locations once felt safe, but now something is off.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for immersion</strong><br>With high-quality visuals and a minimal interface, every space is designed to feel like a real memory. You\u2019re not just playing a game, you're stepping into the past.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play together or get left behind</strong><br>Daydream is a four-player co-op experience. Work with your team to solve puzzles, collect strange items, document entities, and find a way out. Going off alone could cost you everything.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dream that slowly turns</strong><br>At first, the world feels calm and nostalgic. Familiar music, soft lighting, and whimsical colors create a comforting mood. But it doesn\u2019t stay that way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted liminal spaces</strong><br>Each level is designed by hand with no procedural generation. Childhood landmarks are reimagined as eerie, decaying places where nothing feels quite right.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying enemies that learn from you</strong><br>Every entity is unique. Some react to sound. Some follow you quietly. Each one is a puzzle, and your survival depends on paying attention and adapting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-solving with consequences</strong><br>Environmental puzzles are woven into each realm. Solving them unlocks new areas, but also new dangers. Your choices shape the experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound that guides and misleads</strong><br>A mix of eerie ambient sound and nostalgic melodies brings each environment to life. Sometimes comforting. Sometimes haunting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
